2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Boundary\040Delineation\040of\040MRI\040Images\040for\040Lumbar\040Spinal\040Stenosis\040Detection\040Through\040Semantic\040Segmentation\040Using\040Deep\040Neural\040Networks)
/Author (Ala\040S\056\040Al\055Kafri\054\040Sud\040Sudirman\054\040Abir\040Hussain\054\040Dhiya\040Al\055Jumeily\054\040Friska\040Natalia\054\040Hira\040Meidia\054\040Nunik\040Afriliana\054\040Wasfi\040Al\055Rashdan\054\040Mohammad\040Bashtawi\054\040Mohammed\040Al\055Jumaily)
/Subject (We\040propose\040a\040methodology\040to\040aid\040clinicians\040in\040performing\040lumbar\040spinal\040stenosis\040detection\040through\040semantic\040segmentation\040and\040delineation\040of\040magnetic\040resonance\040imaging\040\050MRI\051\040scans\040of\040the\040lumbar\040spine\040using\040deep\040learning\056\040Our\040dataset\040contains\040MRI\040studies\040of\040515\040patients\040with\040symptomatic\040back\040pains\056\040Each\040study\040is\040annotated\040by\040expert\040radiologists\040with\040notes\040regarding\040the\040observed\040characteristics\040and\040condition\040of\040the\040lumbar\040spine\056\040We\040have\040developed\040a\040ground\040truth\040dataset\054\040containing\040image\040labels\040of\040four\040important\040regions\040in\040the\040lumbar\040spine\054\040to\040be\040used\040as\040the\040training\040and\040test\040images\040to\040develop\040classification\040models\040for\040segmentation\056\040We\040developed\040two\040novel\040metrics\054\040namely\040confidence\054\040and\040consistency\054\040to\040assess\040the\040quality\040of\040the\040ground\040truth\040dataset\040through\040a\040derivation\040of\040the\040Jaccard\040Index\056\040We\040experimented\040with\040semantic\040segmentation\040of\040our\040dataset\040using\040SegNet\056\040Our\040evaluation\040of\040the\040segmentation\040and\040the\040delineation\040results\040show\040that\040our\040proposed\040methodology\040produces\040a\040very\040good\040performance\040as\040measured\040by\040several\040contour\055based\040and\040region\055based\040metrics\056\040In\040addition\054\040using\040the\040Cohen\047s\040kappa\040and\040frequency\055weighted\040confidence\040metrics\054\040we\040can\040show\040that\0401\051\040the\040model\047s\040performance\040is\040within\040the\040range\040of\040the\040worst\040and\040the\040best\040manual\040labeling\040results\040and\0402\051\040the\040ground\055truth\040dataset\040has\040an\040excellent\040inter\055rater\040agreement\040score\056\040We\040also\040presented\040two\040representative\040delineation\040results\040of\040the\040worst\040and\040best\040segmentation\040based\040on\040their\040BF\055score\040to\040show\040visually\040how\040accurate\040and\040suitable\040the\040results\040are\040for\040computer\055aided\055diagnosis\040purposes\056)
/Keywords (01\040Apr\0402019\054\040IEEE\040Access\054\040Segmentation\054\040Liverpool\040John\040Moores\040University)
>>
endobj
